(text "SCK 2.3 PM sensor adapter: replaces the Urban board, plugs into the Data board 2x8 socket.\nHeader J1 and connector J2 use the same footprints and positions as the Urban board 2.3 (CONN_DATA, PM_SENSOR).\nJ1 pin numbers follow the Urban board: 1,2 VCC (3V3) | 3 SCL | 5 SDA | 10 +5V (step-up, PA06 PM_ENABLE) | 13,15,16 GND.\nI2C pull-ups (10k to 3V3) are on the Data board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e969afe4-45f7-4fe7-afa7-ed682d2a49e0"))
(text "JP1 selects the PM sensor supply:\n  1-2: +5V  -> SEN5x (4.5-5.5V)\n  2-3: 3V3  -> SEN6x (3.15-3.6V, abs max 3.6V: never 5V)\n3V3 source, fit ONE of R1/R2:\n  R1 (default): AP7361C LDO from the switched +5V (firmware can power the sensor off, isolated from ESP ripple)\n  R2 (DNP): Data board 3V3 rail (always on; to test whether the shared rail is clean enough)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ce3fda9d-129b-4f91-8417-4c430d0b64db"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
